@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

title System Architecture - PN Infra Cognito, API Gateway, and VPC Endpoint

' High-Level Components
RECTANGLE "AWS Account: Cognito" {
    RECTANGLE "CloudFormation Stack: Cognito" {
        RECTANGLE "Cognito User Pool"
        RECTANGLE "Cognito Identity Pool"
        RECTANGLE "User Pool Client"
        RECTANGLE "IAM Roles\n(Authenticated/Unauthenticated)"
    }
}

RECTANGLE "AWS Account: API Gateway" {
    RECTANGLE "CloudFormation Stack: API Gateway" {
        RECTANGLE "API Gateway"
        RECTANGLE "Cognito Authorizer"
        RECTANGLE "WhoAmI Method"
        RECTANGLE "ECS Proxy Method"
        RECTANGLE "VPC Link"
        RECTANGLE "Deployment & Stage"
    }
}

RECTANGLE "VPC Environment" {
    RECTANGLE "VPC"
    RECTANGLE "Subnets"
    RECTANGLE "Security Group"
    RECTANGLE "SQS VPC Endpoint"
}

' External Interfaces
RECTANGLE "External Systems" {
    RECTANGLE "Amazon SQS"
    RECTANGLE "Network Load Balancer"
    RECTANGLE "DNS / Certificate Services"
}

' Relationships
Cognito_User_Pool --> Cognito_Authorizer : Provides ARN
Cognito_Authorizer --> WhoAmI_Method : Protects
Cognito_Authorizer --> ECS_Proxy_Method : Protects
User_Pool_Client --> Identity_Pool : Binds
Identity_Pool --> IAM_Roles : Attaches
API_Gateway --> Deployment_&_Stage : Deploys
WhoAmI_Method --> Deployment_&_Stage : Depends
ECS_Proxy_Method --> Deployment_&_Stage : Depends
ECS_Proxy_Method --> VPC_Link : Integrates via
VPC_Link --> Network_Load_Balancer : Connects to
SQS_VPC_Endpoint --> Amazon_SQS : Privately accesses
VPC --> SQS_VPC_Endpoint : Hosts
Subnets --> SQS_VPC_Endpoint : Associates
Security_Group --> SQS_VPC_Endpoint : Controls access
VPC --> Security_Group : Contains

note right of Cognito_User_Pool
  Configures:
  - Token validity units
  - Custom attributes (Role, email)
end note

note right of Identity_Pool
  Supports:
  - Unauthenticated identities
  - Cognito provider binding
end note

note right of WhoAmI_Method
  Handles:
  - x-pagopa-pn-cx-role header
  - Maps from authorizer claims
end note

note right of ECS_Proxy_Method
  Forwards:
  - Role claim to integration
  - Via x-pagopa-pn-cx-role
end note

note right of SQS_VPC_Endpoint
  Enforces:
  - Private DNS enabled
  - VPC-bound access control
end note

@enduml
